      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Rearrange:\n2×Rahul = Sagar + Purav.\n\nSo Rahul is the average of their ages. If Sagar+Purav=66, Rahul=33.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
